== entries/marsh-walk/index.html
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><title>A walk to the &lt;marsh&gt;</title></head><body><header><nav><a href="/">Field notes</a> <a href="/feed.xml">Feed</a></nav></header><main><article><h1>A walk to the &lt;marsh&gt;</h1><time>2026-10-03</time><p>The path was &#34;dry&#34; until the second gate.</p><p>Notes kept in a notebook, copied here at night.</p></article><nav><h2>See also</h2><ul><li><a href="/entries/heron-count">Heron count</a></li><li><a href="/entries/first-frost">First frost</a></li></ul></nav></main></body></html>
== entries/heron-count/index.html
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><title>Heron count</title></head><body><header><nav><a href="/">Field notes</a> <a href="/feed.xml">Feed</a></nav></header><main><article><h1>Heron count</h1><time>2026-09-14</time><p>Seven grey herons on the east shore at dawn, standing apart from each other, all facing the wind.</p><p>One flew low over the reeds &amp; landed by the sluice.</p></article><nav><h2>See also</h2><ul><li><a href="/entries/first-frost">First frost</a></li></ul></nav></main></body></html>
